">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"96.3\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,57.9 9.1,63.3 14.2,66.6 19.3,70.2 24.5,71.6 29.6,66.8 34.7,61.6 39.8,65.2 44.9,71.8 50.0,70.9 55.1,63.2 60.3,54.7 65.4,48.0 70.5,43.5 75.6,45.3 80.7,38.2 85.8,16.3 91.0,24.4 96.1,12.8 101.2,15.7 106.3,29.7 111.4,34.8 116.5,34.8 121.6,48.0 126.8,52.0 131.9,48.7 137.0,49.0 142.1,57.7 147.2,60.1 152.3,66.9 157.4,61.6 162.6,69.4 167.7,79.3 172.8,69.1 177.9,71.8 183.0,80.1 188.1,83.7 193.2,71.5 198.4,70.0 203.5,75.2 208.6,70.5 213.7,67.2 218.8,70.0 223.9,71.3 229.0,69.3 234.2,69.6 239.3,76.5 244.4,64.2 249.5,71.6 254.6,74.4 259.7,74.9 264.9,77.0 270.0,75.6 275.1,71.3 280.2,70.7 285.3,73.8 290.4,74.6 295.5,80.2 300.7,82.5 305.8,85.4 310.9,87.7 316.0,89.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 69.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"89.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"61.9\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.